    },
    Double Standards: {
        Sexual Norms: Double standards applied to heterosexual and LGBTQ+ individuals.,
        Behavior Judgments: Different expectations and judgments based on sexual orientation and gender identity.
    },
    Fear and Misunderstanding: {
        Fear of the Unknown: Socio-cultural and personal fear linked to unfamiliar identities.,
        Fear of Contagion: Fear that interacting with marginalized groups will 'infect' 'normal' society.
    },
    Empathy and Understanding: {
        Ethical Consideration: Need for empathy and active understanding.,
        Normalization and Acceptance: Efforts to present LGBTQ+ individuals in a non-sensationalized, non-stereotyped way.
    }
}

# Theories
